{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一名男童懷疑不當對待一隻雀，警方暫列殘酷對待動物調查。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BIRD-1800.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026K7wsRpf2qS1790854026.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BIRD-1800.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上片段見到，一名男童懷疑用繩綁著一隻雀，並在地上拖行，該雀沒有反應。據了解，警方接獲一名男子報案，指在網上見到相關片段，懷疑男童虐待動物。警方正調查事件，交由屯門警區刑事調查隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T11:59:06.818620+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}